    "sub_name": "創新商模投資",
    "sub_ename": "INNOVATIVE INVESTMENT ON BUSINESS MODEL",
    "describe_ch": "商模投資有別金融市場資金鏈下游的商品投資 (例如股票、基金、債券)。本課程著重資金鏈上游的商模投資創新想法與應用。培養學生有別於傳統商模經營的投資觀念及能力，提升學生個人競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on innovative ideas and applications of business model investment. The purpose is to cultivate students' investment concept and skill that are different from traditional business model management, and to enhance students' career competitiveness.",
